          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "D2 | PMEG3030EP Schottky | Diode from +5V into the servo power rail (feeding J3/J8 pin 2 and the C1–C4 bank) (page 1)."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The external or M5Stack +5V supply is effectively shorted to ground through the low-drop Schottky diode. The supply may current-limit or be damaged, and the servo power rail will not operate as intended.",
      "confidence": 0.96
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic grounds the servo rail downstream of D1. This contradicts the specified series feed from +5V and creates a supply-to-ground short through the Schottky diode."
